msgstr "少なくとも 1 つのタームを選択してください。"

#. translators: Status shown next to a button on WPML → Support while the change is being written.
#: src/Tool/DatabaseStringsController.php:539
msgid "Updating…"
msgstr "更新中…"

#: src/Tool/DatabaseStringsController.php:564
msgid "All term names updated."
msgstr "すべてのターム名が更新されました。"

#. translators: Status shown next to a button on WPML → Support once its action has finished. Adjective, not the verb "to do".
#: src/Tool/FixLanguageDataController.php:50
